# EigenScript gap: scalar NaNs cannot retain the IEEE sign Lua prints.
# docs/SPEC.md N12 says every float NaN becomes 0x7FF8000000000000, so no
# documented scalar operation can distinguish Lua's positive and negative
# NaN spellings after construction.
print of [(f64_bits of (0.0 / 0.0)), (f64_bits of (-(0.0 / 0.0)))]
